peakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":3594548082,"text":"こんにちは！花の鉢植えを体験しませんか？","nextNodeIds":[726580102]},{"nodeId":726580102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2659328698,"text":"花の鉢植え？","nextNodeIds":[726580103]},{"nodeId":726580103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":138899874,"text":"あっ、興味ありますか？詳しく知らなくても大丈夫です、簡単に説明しますね。","nextNodeIds":[726580104]},{"nodeId":726580104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":2041572642,"text":"私の名前は咲耶。花を育てながら、花に関する商売をしている花職人です。","nextNodeIds":[726580105]},{"nodeId":726580105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":838461130,"text":"あははっ、商売と言っても、ほとんどの場合、花を配達したり、お店で「生け花」を作ったりしているだけですが…","nextNodeIds":[726580106]},{"nodeId":726580106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1234590746,"text":"生け花って…","nextNodeIds":[726580107]},{"nodeId":726580107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":106033234,"text":"えっ？知らないのですか？「生け花」は稲妻ではとても重要なものですよ。","nextNodeIds":[726580108]},{"nodeId":726580108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":56153658,"text":"「生け花」とは、簡単に言えば、花や植物を丁寧に切って、それを適切な形で配置することですが…","nextNodeIds":[726580109]},{"nodeId":726580109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":2627266794,"text":"具体的な操作となると…花や植物を切るには、植物の状態を細かく把握し、見栄えの悪いところを丁寧に直す必要があります…","nextNodeIds":[726580110]},{"nodeId":726580110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":2164211626,"text":"そして置く時は、場所の雰囲気に合わせて調整します。時には、花が外へ伸びる角度まで気を配る必要があります…","nextNodeIds":[726580111]},{"nodeId":726580111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":386171882,"text":"これらの細かなところは、隅々まで考慮しなければなりません…極めて面倒なことです。","nextNodeIds":[726580112]},{"nodeId":726580112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":2951310114,"text":"生け花が好きな私からしても、この仕事は十分に疲れるのですが…","nextNodeIds":[726580113]},{"nodeId":726580113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":1531463002,"text":"昔は、町中にお店を持っていたのですが、町があまりにも騒がしく、生け花をする気になれませんでした。","nextNodeIds":[726580114]},{"nodeId":726580114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":1267282722,"text":"そこで店を閉めて、私自身の花畑のそばでお客さんへのサービスを提供することにしました。","nextNodeIds":[726580115]},{"nodeId":726580115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":1501820362,"text":"しかし…店は静かになりましたが、商売も少々減ってしまいました…","nextNodeIds":[726580116]},{"nodeId":726580116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":3907703106,"text":"そのため、町に来て「咲耶の花屋」を宣伝する計画を考えたのです。","nextNodeIds":[726580117]},{"nodeId":726580117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":2308090778,"text":"私はこの計画を…「花咲きし夢」と呼んでいます！","nextNodeIds":[726580118]},{"nodeId":726580118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4055454754,"text":"具体的な計画は…","nextNodeIds":[726580119]},{"nodeId":726580119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":3625971170,"text":"具体的には、お客さんが花を育て、自分で生け花を作るというイベントです。","nextNodeIds":[726580120]},{"nodeId":726580120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30083,"speakerName":"咲耶","textMapHash":7890986,"text":"もし興味があって体験してみたいと思いましたら、私に教えてくださいね。花の鉢植えでも、生け花の体験でも、どちらも楽しいものですよ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7265801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["72658","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","